  "upstream_retry_not_run": "upstream retries once at (0.1, 0.1) when the first pass grounds nothing; THIS masker does not. apple_sam2's callers DROP an ungrounded frame, so the retry recovers data there; G0c REFUSES the clip, so here it would only suppress a refusal by accepting a weak box that can land on something other than the robot \u2014 a confident wrong mask in place of a loud refusal.",
  "object_grounding_filter": "a detection whose SAM 2 mask has IoU > 0.7 against warm_saturated_rgb(r>90, r-b>50, saturation>0.35) is the OBJECT, not the robot, and is dropped before the union; if that empties the mask, check_mask refuses the clip. PR-08 V9. The detection operating point, the prompt and the union rule are unchanged and no mask is altered."
